    "whyNote": {
      "color": "blue",
      "text": "Why two variants: CarPlay gives driving task apps no full-screen image or custom map. A MapKit map (A) and the Ubilling picture (B) are the only two ways to show the alert map, and each has a different risk (App Review vs. image size). The implementing agent runs a spike on a CarPlay Simulator and real car, then the owner picks one. See docs/decisions and docs/tasks/carplay-map-spike.md.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 2180,
      "y": 2084
    }
